Architectural inspiration
-------------------------

The overall shape of this library -- the separation between client, transport
and connection factory, and the idea of a pluggable HTTP client factory allowing
the User-Agent to be configured -- was inspired by:

    Xtream.Client - Copyright (c) Heni Fazzani
    https://github.com/Fazzani/Xtream.Client
    MIT License

No source file in this project is copied from Xtream.Client; only the
organisational concepts were carried over. The attribution above is kept as a
courtesy and to record where the design came from.
